              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/accounts/sign-in/google",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["accounts", "sign-in", "google"]
            },
            "description": "First run against a token for an address nobody has registered: creates a user with a Google credential and no password. Run again with the same token (or a fresh one for the same Google account) and it signs into the same user instead of creating a second one. Sets access_token/refresh_token cookies exactly like 'Sign in' in the folder above."
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
